 //Data Binding
 1. Interpolation -> {{}}
 2.One way data binding-> [model]="model" or bind-target="model" (from componet to template)
 3.Event Binding->  (click)="anyFunction()" or on-target="anyFunction()"
 4.Two way data binding- [(model)]="model"
 
 Angular 2 follows Unidirectional data binding (either component to template or template to component). Below are the benifits.
 1.No more $apply API call required
 2. No more $digest cycle
 3. No more $watch cycle to be executed
 4. Hence no performance issue with digest and wather cycle.
 
